message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "LNG Tank Pressure Management"
abstract: >-
  Research software for system-level analysis of LNG tank pressure management
  in dual-fuel ships. The model compares pressure build-up, LNG pump, and
  boil-off gas compressor configurations for low-pressure fuel gas supply
  systems.
